<title>FRANCE: AGPB sees French '96 soft wheat crop at 34 mln tns.</title>
<headline>AGPB sees French '96 soft wheat crop at 34 mln tns.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>France may harvest a record 1996 soft wheat crop of 34 tonnes against 29.85 million tonnes in 1995, French wheat growers association AGPB said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The estimate assumes a wheat yield of 7.1 tonnes per hectare and area of 4.781 million hectares, it said.</p>
</text>
